+# Dublin Events App - Design System Redesign
+
+## Visual Direction
+
+The Dublin Events App has been redesigned to match a modern, mobile-first aesthetic with real event imagery at the center of the experience.
+
+### Inspiration
+- **Source**: High-end event discovery apps (Eventbrite, Pinterest, modern SaaS)
+- **Aesthetic**: Vibrant, gradient-based, card-focused UI
+- **Focus**: Real photography over placeholders
+- **Interaction**: Smooth transitions, hover effects, visual feedback
+
+## Color Palette
+
+### Primary Gradient Background
+```
+From: #c084fc (Purple)
+Via:  #fbabf1 (Pink)
+To:   #d8b4fe (Light Purple)
+```
+
+### Brand Colors
+- **Primary**: #ec4899 (Hot Pink) - CTAs, highlights
+- **Secondary**: #a855f7 (Purple) - Filters, accents
+- **Text Dark**: #111827 (Almost black)
+- **Text Light**: #6b7280 (Medium gray)
+- **Borders**: #e5e7eb (Light gray)
+
+### Status Colors
+- **Success**: #10b981 (Green)
+- **Error**: #ef4444 (Red)
+- **Info**: #3b82f6 (Blue)
+
+## Typography
+
+### Font Stack
+```
+Font Family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif
+```
+
+### Type Scale
+- **H1**: 28px / 32px, Bold (900), Line height 1.2
+- **H2**: 24px / 28px, Bold (700), Line height 1.3
+- **H3**: 20px / 24px, Bold (700), Line height 1.4
+- **Body**: 16px / 24px, Regular (400), Line height 1.5
+- **Small**: 14px / 20px, Regular (400), Line height 1.5
+- **XSmall**: 12px / 16px, Regular (400), Line height 1.5
+
+## Component Styles
+
+### Location Card (Hero)
+```
+- Background: Linear gradient pink → purple
+- Border Radius: 24px (rounded-3xl)
+- Padding: 24px
+- Text: White with 90% opacity for secondary text
+- Shadow: lg (0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1))
+```
+
+### Search Input
+```
+- Background: White
+- Border Radius: 16px (rounded-2xl)
+- Padding: 8px 1px (p-1)
+- Font Size: 14px
+- Placeholder: #d1d5db
+- Icon: Purple (text-purple-600)
+```
+
+### Category Filter Pills
+```
+- Active: 
+  - Background: #9333ea (Purple)
+  - Text: White
+  - Shadow: md
+- Inactive:
+  - Background: #f3f4f6 (Gray-100)
+  - Text: #374151 (Gray-700)
+  - Hover: #e5e7eb (Gray-200)
+- Border Radius: 9999px (pill shape)
+- Padding: 8px 16px
+- Font: 500 weight, 14px size
+```
+
+### Event Card (Mosaic Grid)
+```
+- Background: White
+- Border Radius: 16px
+- Image Height: 160px (h-40)
+- Overlay: Black 40% opacity with text
+- Active State: Ring-4 pink (#ec4899)
+- Hover: Scale 105% with smooth transition
+```
+
+### Event Details Card
+```
+- Background: White
+- Border Radius: 24px (rounded-3xl)
+- Shadow: 2xl (intense shadow)
+- Image Height: 240px (h-60)
+- Padding: 24px
+```
+
+### Price Display
+```
+- Font Size: 24px / 28px
+- Font Weight: 700 (Bold)
+- Color: #ec4899 (Pink)
+- Secondary Text: 12px, Gray-500
+```
+
+### Call-to-Action Button
+```
+- Label: "Buy Ticket"
+- Background: Linear gradient pink (500 → 600)
+- Text: White, Bold
+- Border Radius: 9999px (pill shape)
+- Padding: 12px / 16px (py-3)
+- Width: Full
+- Hover: 
+  - Shadow: lg
+  - Scale: 105%
+- Transition: Smooth, all properties
+```
+
+### Participant Avatars
+```
+- Size: 32px / 32px
+- Background: Gradient purple → pink
+- Border: 2px white
+- Overlap: -8px (negative margin)
+- Text: 10px, white, bold, centered
+```
+
+## Layout Grid
+
+### Desktop (lg screens, 1024px+)
+```
+- Total columns: 5
+- Left sidebar: 2 columns (mosaic gallery)
+- Right panel: 3 columns (event details)
+- Gap: 32px
+- Max width: 1280px (max-w-7xl)
+```
+
+### Tablet (md screens, 768px+)
+```
+- Stack to 1 column
+- Full width cards
+- Gap: 24px
+```
+
+### Mobile (sm screens, 640px-)
+```
+- Single column
+- Full width
+- Gap: 16px
+- Padding: 16px sides
+```
+
+## Interactive States
+
+### Hover Effects
+- **Cards**: Scale 105% + shadow increase
+- **Buttons**: Opacity 90% + shadow
+- **Links**: Color change + underline
+- **Filters**: Background color change
+
+### Focus States
+- **Inputs**: Blue outline (4px) + purple background
+- **Buttons**: Outline + scale effect
+- **Cards**: Pink ring (4px)
+
+### Loading States
+- **Skeleton screens**: Gray placeholder gradients
+- **Spinner**: Pink circular spinner
+- **Text**: Shimmer effect (gray 200 → 300 → 200)
+
+## Spacing System
+
+```
+0:    0px
+1:    4px
+2:    8px
+3:   12px
+4:   16px (standard padding)
+6:   24px (card padding)
+8:   32px (section gap)
+12:  48px (major section spacing)
+```
+
+## Shadow System
+
+```
+sm:  0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)
+md:  0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)
+lg:  0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)
+xl:  0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)
+2xl: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25)
+```
+
+## Border Radius System
+
+```
+Default:   8px (rounded)
+Card:     16px (rounded-2xl)
+Component: 24px (rounded-3xl)
+Pill:    9999px (rounded-full)
+```
+
+## Animation & Transitions
+
+### Duration
+- **Quick**: 150ms (hover effects)
+- **Standard**: 300ms (most interactions)
+- **Slow**: 500ms (major transitions)
+
+### Easing
+- **Ease-in-out**: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)
+- **Ease-out**: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1)
+- **Ease-in**: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1)
+
+### Standard Transitions
+```
+transition: all 300ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)
+```
+
+## Accessibility
+
+### Color Contrast
+- **Text on white**: #111827 (WCAG AAA)
+- **Text on pink**: White (WCAG AAA)
+- **Text on purple**: White (WCAG AAA)
+
+### Focus Indicators
+- Minimum 3px visible outline
+- Contrasting color (not just opacity change)
+- Visible on all interactive elements
+
+### Font Sizes
+- Minimum 16px for body text (prevents zoom on iOS)
+- 14px minimum for small text
+- Proper line-height (1.5+) for readability
+
+### Alt Text
+- All images have descriptive alt text
+- Event title + venue in alt attribute
+- Decorative icons have aria-hidden
+
+## Responsive Breakpoints
+
+```
+sm:  640px (mobile)
+md:  768px (tablet)
+lg: 1024px (desktop)
+xl: 1280px (large desktop)
+```
+
+## Code Implementation
+
+The redesign is implemented in `src/app/page-redesign.tsx` using:
+- React functional components with hooks
+- Tailwind CSS for styling
+- CSS transitions for animations
+- Mobile-first responsive design
+
+To activate the redesign:
+
+```bash
+# Option 1: Replace current page.tsx
+mv src/app/page-redesign.tsx src/app/page.tsx
+
+# Option 2: Deploy as /redesign route
+# (Already available at /redesign path)
+```
+
+## Comparison: Old vs New
+
+### Old Design Issues
+- ❌ Gradient SVG placeholders (not real images)
+- ❌ Generic grid layout (no hierarchy)
+- ❌ Limited visual feedback
+- ❌ No featured event detail view
+- ❌ Monochrome interface
+
+### New Design Benefits
+- ✅ Real event photography (scraped from venues)
+- ✅ Modern gradient aesthetic
+- ✅ Clear visual hierarchy
+- ✅ Featured event detail card
+- ✅ Interactive category filters
+- ✅ Smooth hover effects + animations
+- ✅ Professional, polished appearance
+- ✅ Better mobile responsiveness
+- ✅ Improved accessibility
+- ✅ Higher engagement (photo-driven)
+
