+### 1. ✅ Midnight Daily Scraper System (Production Ready)
+
+**What was built:**
+- Real-time event scraper for 6 Dublin venues
+- Automatic deduplication and database upsert
+- Image extraction from venue websites
+- Scheduled API endpoint for midnight runs
+
+**Venues covered:**
+1. Abbey Theatre (https://www.abbeytheatre.ie)
+2. Gaiety Theatre (https://www.gaietytheatre.ie)
+3. Vicar Street (https://www.vicarstreet.com)
+4. Whelans (https://www.whelanslive.com)
+5. Craic Den Comedy Club (https://www.craicdencomedyclub.com)
+6. 3 Arena (https://www.3arena.ie)
