+- `src/app/api/scrape/midnight/route.ts` - Scheduled endpoint
+- `src/lib/scrapers/midnight-scraper.ts` - Orchestration logic
+- `SCRAPER_SETUP.md` - Complete deployment guide
+
+**Deployment Instructions:**
+```bash
+# 1. Set environment variable on Railway:
+SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY="your-secret-key-value"
+
+# 2. Trigger via EasyCron, GitHub Actions, or Railway Jobs:
+POST https://yourapp.railway.app/api/scrape/midnight?key=your-secret-key
+
+# 3. Set schedule: 0 0 * * * (midnight UTC daily)
+```
+
+**Key Features:**
+- ✅ Extracts real photographic images (not CDN placeholders)
+- ✅ Event deduplication (no duplicates on re-runs)
+- ✅ Automatic venue creation + linking
+- ✅ Source tracking for audit trail
+- ✅ Comprehensive error handling
+- ✅ JSON response with event counts per venue
