+## 🔧 Technical Details
+
+### Scraper Architecture
+```
+1. EnhancedTheaterScraper (base class)
+   ├── Fetch venue's "What's On" page
+   ├── Parse HTML with Cheerio
+   ├── Extract: title, date, price, description, image URL
+   └── Database save via BaseScraper.saveEvents()
+
+2. Database Upsert Logic
+   ├── Find/create venue
+   ├── Check for duplicate events (title + date + venue)
+   ├── Create new event OR skip if exists
+   └── Link to source via EventSource table
+
+3. API Endpoint
+   ├── Authenticate via SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY
+   ├── Run all 6 scrapers in sequence
+   ├── Return JSON with results + event counts
+   └── Log to Railway console
+```
+
+### Design Implementation
+```
+React Component (page-redesign.tsx)
+├── State: events[], selectedEvent, filters, search
+├── Sections:
+│   ├── Header with location + settings
+│   ├── Location card with search bar
+│   ├── Event mosaic gallery (2x3 grid)
+│   ├── Category filters
+│   └── Event detail card (right panel)
+└── Styling: Tailwind CSS + Tailwind config
+
+Color Palette:
+├── Gradient background: purple → pink → purple
+├── Primary buttons: hot pink (#ec4899)
+├── Filters: purple (#a855f7)
+├── Text: dark gray (#111827)
+└── Cards: white with shadow effects
+```
